@{
    Layout = "_LayoutPublic";
    ViewData["Title"] = "AI-Powered Smart Port Operations";
}
<section class="spx-hero"><div class="container spx-hero__grid"><div><div class="spx-kicker">Culltron Smart Port Flow · Enterprise AI operations prototype</div><h1>From Port Congestion to Driver Execution — in One AI Workflow</h1><p class="spx-lead">Culltron Smart Port Flow connects control-room recommendations, fleet-owner coordination, driver mobile instructions, WhatsApp LiveTest workflows, and emissions impact tracking.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a href="/dashboard" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg">Open Live Demo</a><a href="/fleet" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg">View Fleet Dashboard</a><a href="/driver" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg">Driver Queue Companion</a></div><p class="spx-note">Demo mode uses synthetic operational data. Live WhatsApp and Gemini activate only when credentials are configured server-side.</p></div><div class="spx-flow-panel" aria-label="Smart Port workflow"><div class="spx-node">Control Room</div><div class="spx-node">Execution Plan</div><div class="spx-node">Fleet Owner</div><div class="spx-node">Driver App</div><div class="spx-node">WhatsApp Check-In</div><div class="spx-node spx-node--impact">Impact + Audit</div></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section"><div class="container"><div class="spx-section__head"><h2>Smart Port closes the loop</h2><p>It does not stop at recommendations: every demo action is designed to update queue state, timeline, audit history, mobile APIs and driver-facing instructions.</p></div><div class="spx-workflow">@foreach(var step in new[]{("01","Detect congestion"),("02","Generate execution plan"),("03","Notify fleet owner"),("04","Send driver instruction"),("05","Driver confirms / shares location"),("06","ETA/status updates"),("07","CO₂/idling impact measured"),("08","Audit trail recorded")}){<div class="spx-step"><span>@step.Item1</span><strong>@step.Item2</strong></div>}</div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section spx-section--deep"><div class="container"><div class="spx-section__head"><h2>Product surfaces for the hackathon demo</h2><p>Styled previews below link to the live pages already present in the application.</p></div><div class="spx-card-grid">@foreach(var card in new[]{("Fleet Dashboard","Live truck queue, risk, execution plan and impact metrics.","/fleet"),("Driver Queue Companion","Driver status page with confirmations, ETA and Copilot actions.","/driver"),("WhatsApp Notifications","Simulated history plus LiveTest readiness when Meta credentials exist.","/fleet/notifications"),("Execution Plan","Truck-level actions, reasons, call-forward times and CO₂ avoided.","/execution"),("Android Companion","Native Kotlin app source, build steps and APK status.","/fleet/download-app"),("Data Sources","Honest integration readiness for IPMS/TOS/gate/fleet feeds.","/fleet/data-sources")}){<a class="spx-product" href="@card.Item3"><span></span><h3>@card.Item1</h3><p>@card.Item2</p></a>}</div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section"><div class="container spx-split"><div><h2>Enterprise value</h2><p>Smart Port coordinates port operators, fleet owners and drivers so truck movement instructions become auditable operational execution.</p><ul class="sp-checklist"><li>Reduce avoidable truck idling and gate spillback</li><li>Improve staging, gate and fleet visibility</li><li>Give drivers clear next actions through web, Android and WhatsApp LiveTest</li><li>Create a timeline and audit trail for decisions and acknowledgements</li><li>Support sustainability reporting with measured demo idling/CO₂ impact</li></ul></div><div class="spx-metric-stack"><div><strong>Queue</strong><span>Driver-ready instruction flow</span></div><div><strong>ETA</strong><span>Updated by confirmations and WhatsApp location check-ins</span></div><div><strong>Audit</strong><span>Timeline, notification history and mobile API state</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section spx-section--deep"><div class="container spx-split"><div class="spx-glow-card"><h2>Gemini-powered, fallback-safe Copilot</h2><p>When <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code> and Gemini settings are configured, Smart Port Copilot uses Gemini for scoped operational explanations. Without it, deterministic fallback remains available.</p><p>It is not a generic chatbot: prompts are constrained to Smart Port queue, gate, staging, driver and fleet-owner workflows.</p><a href="/Copilot" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">Open Copilot</a></div><div class="spx-glow-card"><h2>WhatsApp + Android driver coordination</h2><p>Drivers can receive a queue instruction, reply <code>STATUS</code>, <code>HOW LONG</code> or <code>ARRIVED_GATE</code>, and share WhatsApp location check-ins. The Android companion reads and writes through backend APIs and stores no secrets.</p><p>No SMS. No continuous GPS tracking claim. Location is driver-shared check-in only.</p><a href="/fleet/settings" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline">Check readiness</a></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section"><div class="container spx-split"><div><h2>Integration readiness, stated honestly</h2><p>The current hackathon demo uses synthetic operational data. In a controlled pilot, Smart Port can connect to IPMS, terminal operating systems, gate appointment systems, berth/yard feeds, fleet systems, WhatsApp Cloud API and later telematics/GPS where approved.</p><p>These are integration paths, not claims of live production port connectivity.</p></div><div><h2>Demo mode safety</h2><ul class="sp-checklist"><li>Demo mode works without paid providers</li><li>LiveTest WhatsApp only sends when Meta credentials are configured</li><li>LiveTest is blocked unless the driver is approved and consented</li><li>Gemini is optional and fallback remains available</li><li>No hardcoded API keys, tokens, registration numbers or fake contact details</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section spx-final"><div class="container"><h2>Ready for the Smart Port execution demo</h2><p>Show the loop from AI control-room recommendation to fleet owner operations console, driver acknowledgement, WhatsApp location check-in, Android/mobile API update and measured idling/CO₂ impact.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a href="/fleet" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg">Start with Fleet Dashboard</a><a href="/execution/plans" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg">View Execution Plans</a></div></div></section>
